From a728d5595e42e5a0bf025da3ee4a02efeda3d371 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Azan (via Claude)" <azan@local>
Date: Wed, 26 Aug 2026 18:17:23 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: activity feed, friends, avatar upload fix,
 auto-complete episodes, profile pagination

- Log activity (watching/completed/planning/rated/favourited/reviewed)
  on every real state transition via new ActivityService + Activity model
- Add simple one-directional friends (follow, no accept step) with
  search-and-add UI in Community > Members, plus GET/POST/DELETE /api/friends
- Add GET /api/activity/feed (self + friends) and a feed section on
  the dashboard with load-more pagination
- Fix avatar upload: switch multer to memory storage + base64 data URI
  (disk storage never persisted on Vercel's serverless filesystem) and
  actually register the upload route, which was never mounted
- Add strict image validation for both uploads (magic-number sniffing)
  and the manual avatar URL field (extension + protocol whitelist),
  client and server side
- Auto-fill progress to totalEpisodes/totalChapters when an entry is
  marked COMPLETED, in both updateLibrary and markAllCompleted
- Add lazy-loaded images + Load More pagination to the profile
  watched/completed grid instead of rendering everything at once
- Split achievements into their own page (/profile/achievements) with
  a pinned flag (max 6) so only selected achievements show on profile
- Fix profile page 'reload' bug: removed the unconditional refetch()
  on every ProfilePage mount; achievements now sync via useLibrary
  after a new unlock instead of re-fetching /api/me on every visit
